"Conan!" you whisper, "the rifle...shoot!"
By shaking hands Conan points father's double-barrelled rifle at the beast... Seconds pass long, agonizingly slow...
Finally, he fires. You expect wild roar of a furious predator, but instead he shook, moved one step back and silently fell on the ground. Only a few minutes after, you pull yourself together and dare to come up to the beast. It appears, that by some miracle Conan hit him in the eye, death was instantaneous. Unbelievable luck!